<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal non-EU trade deficit Apr 66.7 bln esc.</title>
<headline>Portugal non-EU trade deficit Apr 66.7 bln esc.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's trade deficit with countries outside the European Union rose 21.3 percent to 66.7 billion escudos in April 1997 compared with the previous month, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>		     Apr 97  Mar 97  Apr 96  Jan-Apr 97 Jan-Apr 96</p>
<p> IMPORTS	   129.2   116.4   123.0   472.8	443.8</p>
<p> EXPORTS	    62.5    61.4    62.3   238.3	243.6</p>
<p> DEFICIT	    66.7    55.0    60.7   234.5	200.2</p>
<p>Note - Figures are in billions of escudos.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
